message: "If you use ZEOS in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "ZEOS: A Transformer Operating System"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "van den Hengel"
    given-names: "Anton"
  - family-names: "Avraham"
    given-names: "Gil"
  - family-names: "Zhang"
