repository-code: "https://github.com/metacognitionai/zeos"
abstract: >-
  ZEOS programs transformer-mediated systems the way real-time operating
  systems are programmed: a hierarchy of task descriptors scheduled by a
  kernel, with priority-preemptive scheduling, protected mode, and virtual
  context for LLM jobs.
